    "Title": "Show HN: I trained a 125M model to autocomplete piano on-device",
    "Url": "https://simedw.com/2026/08/20/midi-autocomplete/",
    "Description": "I trained a 125M-parameter transformer to autocomplete piano performances in real time (~108 notes\u0026#x2F;sec on an iPhone 15).\u003Cp\u003EThe idea is basically GitHub Copilot or Tabnine, except instead of prompting it with code, you prompt it by playing a few notes on a MIDI piano. The model then continues what you played, entirely on-device.\u003Cp\u003EThe app is free if anyone wants to try it. Happy to answer questions about the model, training, Core ML, or the many things that didn\u0026#x27;t work.",
